<h1>🔥SURVIVAL SEASONING🔥</h1>

Smoky, Texas style barbecue seasoning with a kick and some zing! 270g per jar. * Garlic and onion-free. Contains brown sugar. Heat level medium. *
This is a recipe I developed and started making in 2021 and multiple times since, with minor changes to sugar and spice levels. It started out as a brisket seasoning to give my pregnant wife a way to maintain and incorporate beef into her diet after developing a distaste for many prepared foods, eggs and other common seasonings following a C-19 infection. Since then, I've continued to make batches as we use it and given some to friends and family. I've yet to have the recipe tested for uniqueness but would love to go through the process. We enjoy it and hope you do too! 
Great on: Brisket, Chuck Roast, Ribs, Chicken Thighs, and works in a sauce or marinade!
